# fixedbugs, defect 538, lane b17-emit, 2026-10-09 (panel 200's R1).
#
# `fixedbugs-538-two-headers-refused-together-are-both-told` with its two
# groups swapped: clang now refuses `fixedbugs-538-long.h` and points at
# `fixedbugs-538-int.h`, and until 2026-10-09 the message blamed
# `fixedbugs-538-long.h` alone, on its own group. The diagnostic is the same
# words as the case beside, on the same group's string.

extern "fixedbugs-538-int.h"  #~ ffi_header_refused
    function thrice(x: i32) -> i32

extern "fixedbugs-538-long.h"
    function twice(x: i64) -> i64

function main()
    print(twice(x: 3))
    print(thrice(x: 4))
